{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jxZQEtKO351793798189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>伊朗最高領袖稱，美國中期選舉結果不會改變美方敵意。</p><p></p><p>伊朗最高領袖穆傑塔巴說，那些認為美國中期選舉結果能夠改變美方對伊朗敵意的人大錯特錯。他說，若果對美國這個霸權敵人稍為有屈服的傾向，就會令其更加肆無忌憚。他警告如果美國再攻擊伊朗，將會面對更大規模的反擊。</p><p></p><p>而伊朗伊斯蘭議會議長卡利巴夫稱，美國中期選舉的結果表明，美國人民拒絕戰爭，伊方支持這一立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.914204+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.771868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:32.117987+00:00","content_hash":"d0b57d378c1bbb1f1b57a831b86d59d7fe36d629ea7bee5a7212d276b8ec4561","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.914204+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}